ne-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2011/10/18(火) 19:56:20 ID:H4eX7bW1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ソフトのセーブデータ見た？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/18(火) 19:59:03 ID:Q7mK2pA9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まだ。帰宅してすぐケース開けてここ来た</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2011/10/18(火) 20:00:28 ID:C9vP4kL1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">先にゲームやれよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2011/10/18(火) 20:02:52 ID:B6rT8xN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">割り箸の謎解きが本編</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2011/10/18(火) 20:03:58 ID:F5aZ9tU3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">明日店に聞くのが早い</div></div><div class=\"res\" 